# Eject can't be countered (CR 101.2): Bot1 casts it at its own Ornithopter - a nonland permanent of the caster's is a legal
# target - and Bot2 answers with Pyroblast, whose first mode counters a blue spell. Eject is blue, but it is not countered: the
# Pyroblast resolves and does nothing, and Eject returns the Ornithopter to Bot1's hand and draws a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Eject
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Pyroblast
Island x18

